        {
          "id": "doc-0102810877e7::sentence-80",
          "documentId": "doc-0102810877e7",
          "text": "Senate Majority Leader Mitch McConnell said Thursday “we have the votes” to confirm Supreme Court nominee Amy Coney Barrett.\n",
          "start": 8567,
          "end": 8692,
          "context": "McConnell says 'we have the votes' to confirm Barrett, tees up final confirmation for week before election\n Senate Majority Leader Mitch McConnell said Thursday “we have the votes” to confirm Supreme Court nominee Amy Coney Barrett.\n The full Senate would start to consider her nomination on Oct. 23, he said, a day after the Senate Judiciary Committee is scheduled to vote on her nomination, which would move the final confirmation vote to the full Senate.\n"
